  "html": "<article id=\"post-65\" class=\"container post-65 page type-page status-publish has-post-thumbnail hentry\">\n\n\t<div class=\"entry-content | container\">\n\t\t<section  class=\"container section--services-hero pt-5 services-hero\">\n\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main\">\n\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row__left\">\n                <div class=\"acf-innerblocks-container\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group full-width-mobile is-vertical is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-2c90304e wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group flow center-content-mobile full-width-mobile has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group h-align icon-plus-title is-layout-flex wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">    <div class=\"iconblock wp-elements-1 has-background has-red-background-color has-text-color has-secondary-inverse-color\" data-size=\"md\" data-padding=\"2\" data-display=\"inline\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-info\" /></svg>    </div>\n\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading has-secondary-color has-text-color has-link-color has-x-large-font-size wp-elements-2\">About Happy Home Services</h1>\n</div>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Happy Home Services is Durham, NC&#8217;s go-to provider for top-quality HVAC and plumbing solutions, committed to keeping local homes comfortable and efficient year-round. With over 50 years of trusted service across the <strong>Durham</strong>, <strong>Chapel Hill</strong>, <strong>Raleigh</strong>, and <strong>Alamance County </strong>areas, we bring expertise, energy savings, and lasting comfort to your doorstep. Our dedicated team is available 24/7 to respond to any HVAC or plumbing emergency, ensuring your home stays safe and worry-free. As a community-focused company, we prioritize not only high-quality service but also a commitment to excellence; each technician is extensively trained, background-checked, and passionate about providing dependable, lasting solutions tailored to meet the needs of Durham&#8217;s residents.</p>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group mb-1 full-width-mobile is-content-justification-left is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-a1b15d37 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<div  class=\"wp-block-group mb-3 full-width-mobile schedule-and-call-cta is-content-justification-left is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-a1b15d37 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group schedule-cta-container is-vertical is-content-justification-stretch is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-41171c72 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<a href=\"/bookings\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"solid\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-level=\"primary\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta se-widget-button\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-event\" /></svg><span >Schedule Now</span>\n\n</a>\n\n    <p class=\"horizon-text has-secondary-font-family wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"text-transform:uppercase\">or speak with an expert!</p>\n\n<a href=\"tel:+13362819025\" aria-label=\"Call now: +13362819025\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"solid\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-level=\"primary\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta phone-link\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-phone\" /></svg><span data-show-on=\"desktop\">(336) 281-9025</span>\n        <span data-show-on=\"mobile\">Call Now</span>\n</a>\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color has-secondary-font-family has-small-font-size text-center wp-elements-3 wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"text-transform:uppercase\"><strong>Same Day Appointments Available by Phone</strong></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div  class=\"badge mb-3\" style='min-height:unset;'>\n    <div class=\"badge__content\">\n        <svg width=\"45\" height=\"45\" viewBox=\"0 0 45 45\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n            <title>Google</title>\n            <path d=\"M42.0046 22.9145C42.0046 21.4661 41.8746 20.0733 41.6332 18.7363H22.395V26.647H33.3882C32.9054 29.191 31.457 31.3451 29.2844 32.7935V37.9373H35.9137C39.7762 34.372 42.0046 29.1353 42.0046 22.9145Z\" fill=\"#4285F4\"/>\n            <path d=\"M22.396 42.8766C27.9112 42.8766 32.535 41.0568 35.9147 37.9371L29.2854 32.7933C27.4655 34.0189 25.1443 34.7617 22.396 34.7617C17.0851 34.7617 12.5727 31.1777 10.9571 26.3496H4.16064V31.6234C7.52175 38.2899 14.4111 42.8766 22.396 42.8766Z\" fill=\"#34A853\"/>\n            <path d=\"M10.9608 26.3308C10.5523 25.1052 10.3109 23.8053 10.3109 22.4498C10.3109 21.0942 10.5523 19.7943 10.9608 18.5687V13.2949H4.16436C2.77164 16.0432 1.97314 19.1444 1.97314 22.4498C1.97314 25.7551 2.77164 28.8563 4.16436 31.6046L9.45671 27.4821L10.9608 26.3308Z\" fill=\"#FBBC05\"/>\n            <path d=\"M22.396 10.155C25.4043 10.155 28.0783 11.1949 30.2138 13.2004L36.0633 7.35097C32.5165 4.04557 27.9112 2.02148 22.396 2.02148C14.4111 2.02148 7.52175 6.60818 4.16064 13.2933L10.9571 18.567C12.5727 13.7389 17.0851 10.155 22.396 10.155Z\" fill=\"#EA4335\"/>\n        </svg>\n        <div class=\"badge__content__rating-container\">\n            <p class=\"h6 badge__content__rating-container__title\">Google Rating</p>\n            <div class=\"badge__content__rating-container__stars\">\n                <div class=\"badge__content__rating-container__stars__number\">\n                    5                </div>\n                <div class=\"badge__content__rating-container__stars__container\">\n                    <div class=\"badge__content__rating-container__stars__container__black\">★★★★★</div>\n                    <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"badge__content__rating-container__stars__container__white\">☆☆☆☆☆</div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n    </div></div>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\t\t\t</div><!-- ./left -->\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row__right\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elevated content-fullbleed-mobile box-shadow-lg border-radius-lg\" >\n    <div class=\"acf-innerblocks-container\">\n\t\t\t<figure class=\"wp-block-post-featured-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" src=\"/images/2024/11/NU-HappyHome_Stock-9-scaled.jpg\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"The entrance of Happy Home Heating and Cooling in Durham, NC\" style=\"object-fit:cover;\" srcset=\"/images/2024/11/NU-HappyHome_Stock-9-scaled.jpg 2560w, /images/2024/11/NU-HappyHome_Stock-9-300x200.jpg 300w, /images/2024/11/NU-HappyHome_Stock-9-1024x683.jpg 1024w, /images/2024/11/NU-HappyHome_Stock-9-768x512.jpg 768w, /images/2024/11/NU-HappyHome_Stock-9-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, /images/2024/11/NU-HappyHome_Stock-9-2048x1365.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1010px) 100vw, (max-width: 1440px) 50vw, 768px\" /></figure>\n\t\t\t</div>\n</div>\t\t\t</div><!-- ./right -->\n\t\t</div><!-- ./row -->\n\n</div>\n\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main section--services-hero__main--empty has-background has-secondary-background-color\">\n\t</div><!-- ./row -->\n\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group container flow pb-4 has-primary-inverse-color has-secondary-background-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-elements-4\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group container flow pb-4 has-primary-inverse-color has-secondary-background-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-elements-5\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-left mt-0 h-decorator--white h-decorator-md h-decorator\"><strong><span class=\"has-inline-color has-secondary-inverse-color\">Why Choose Happy Home?</span></strong></h2>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group wrap-mobile is-horizontal is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-a2f35af1 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-7387b849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column flow is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"has-secondary-inverse-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-6 wp-block-paragraph\">At <strong>Happy Home</strong>, we don’t just provide home services—we deliver exceptional experiences. Our team of skilled professionals is passionate about helping families like yours enjoy safe, efficient, and well-functioning homes. Whether you need <strong>HVAC repairs or plumbing</strong> services, we’re here to get the job done right, the first time.</p>\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><span class=\"has-inline-color has-secondary-inverse-color\">Transparent Pricing—No Hidden Fees</span></strong></h4>\n\n<p class=\"has-secondary-inverse-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-7 wp-block-paragraph\">We understand how frustrating unexpected costs can be, which is why we believe in <strong>complete transparency</strong>. With Happy Home, you’ll receive clear, upfront pricing with no hidden charges—ever. We value your trust, and our commitment to honest pricing ensures you feel confident in your decision to work with us.</p>\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><span class=\"has-inline-color has-secondary-inverse-color\">24/7 Emergency Services</span></strong></h4>\n\n<p class=\"has-secondary-inverse-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-8 wp-block-paragraph\">Home emergencies don’t wait for convenient hours, and neither do we. Whether it&#8217;s the middle of the night, a weekend, or a holiday, our team is available <strong>24/7</strong> to assist you. No matter the time, we’re just a phone call away to keep your home safe and comfortable.</p>\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><span class=\"has-inline-color has-secondary-inverse-color\">Convenient Scheduling &amp; Support</span></strong></h4>\n\n<p class=\"has-secondary-inverse-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-9 wp-block-paragraph\">Booking a service with Happy Home is quick and hassle-free. Our <strong>online scheduling system</strong> lets you set up appointments at your convenience, anytime, anywhere. Need assistance? Our <strong>24/7 chat support</strong> ensures you always have access to expert help when you need it most.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column flow has-secondary-inverse-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-10 is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><span class=\"has-inline-color has-secondary-inverse-color\">Exclusive Perks for Maintenance Members</span></strong></h4>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Preventative maintenance is key to keeping your home in top condition. Our maintenance members enjoy <strong>priority scheduling</strong>, ensuring faster service when you need it most. Regular checkups help prevent costly repairs and keep your home running efficiently—because your time and comfort matter.</p>\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><span class=\"has-inline-color has-secondary-inverse-color\">Committed to our Community</span></strong></h4>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We believe in making a difference, not just in the homes we service, but in the communities we serve. Through active participation in <strong>local events and initiatives</strong>, we give back and support families in need. When you choose Happy Home, you&#8217;re supporting a company that truly cares.</p>\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><span class=\"has-inline-color has-secondary-inverse-color\">Experience the Happy Home Difference</span></strong></h4>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">You deserve a home that functions flawlessly, and <strong>Happy Home</strong> is here to make that happen. Our team of skilled professionals delivers high-quality service with honesty, reliability, and expertise. From emergency repairs to routine maintenance, we’re committed to keeping your home comfortable, safe, and stress-free.</p>\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><span class=\"has-inline-color has-secondary-inverse-color\">Connect with us!</span></strong></h4>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Join the thousands of homeowners who trust <strong>Happy Home</strong> for their home service needs. Whether it’s a repair, maintenance service, or a simple question, we’re here for you—<strong>24/7</strong>.</p>\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-right has-secondary-font-family has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>&#8211; Jackie Gregory, General Manager</strong></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"our-promise container should-overlap should-overlap--secondary\" >\n<div class=\"elevated content-fullbleed-mobile box-shadow-lg border-radius-lg\">\n\n<figure class=\"our-promise__photo\">\n<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"428\" src=\"/images/2024/03/A-Happy-Home-Services-technician-behind-the-wheel-of-a-Happy-Home-Services-van-1024x684.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"A Happy Home Services technician behind the wheel of a Happy Home Services van\" srcset=\"/images/2024/03/A-Happy-Home-Services-technician-behind-the-wheel-of-a-Happy-Home-Services-van-1024x684.jpg 1024w, /images/2024/03/A-Happy-Home-Services-technician-behind-the-wheel-of-a-Happy-Home-Services-van-300x200.jpg 300w, /images/2024/03/A-Happy-Home-Services-technician-behind-the-wheel-of-a-Happy-Home-Services-van-768x513.jpg 768w, /images/2024/03/A-Happy-Home-Services-technician-behind-the-wheel-of-a-Happy-Home-Services-van-1536x1026.jpg 1536w, /images/2024/03/A-Happy-Home-Services-technician-behind-the-wheel-of-a-Happy-Home-Services-van.jpg 1916w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" /></figure>\n<div class=\"our-promise__info\">\n    <p class=\"h3 our-promise__info__headline\">Experts in HVAC, Plumbing &amp; Indoor Air Quality in Durham and Surrounding Areas</p>\n    <div class=\"our-promise__info__description\">From cozy winters to cool summers, we are dedicated to providing top-notch HVAC and indoor air quality services in Durham, NC, ensuring your home remains comfortable and healthy throughout the year. Our expert technicians specialize in a full range of HVAC services, from installation and repairs to routine maintenance, ensuring your heating and cooling systems operate efficiently no matter the season. We understand the importance of indoor air quality for your health, which is why we offer advanced solutions to remove allergens, pollutants, and humidity imbalances, giving you cleaner, fresher air. Our team is committed to delivering exceptional service with a focus on customer satisfaction, offering transparent pricing and reliable, high-quality work. Whether you need emergency HVAC repairs, an energy-efficient system upgrade, or an indoor air quality assessment, we tailor our services to meet the specific needs of your home or business. As a trusted company in Durham, NC, we take pride in supporting our community with personalized, top-tier HVAC and air quality services. Contact us today to experience unparalleled comfort and breathe healthier air in your home. Let us be your trusted partner for all your HVAC and indoor air quality needs!</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div id=\"our-certifications\" class=\"container certifications-and-awards py-5\">\n    <h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center mb-4 d-inline-block h-decorator h-decorator--primary\">Our Certifications &amp; Awards</h2>\n<div  class=\"logocarousel\" style=\"--count: 2;\" data-logo-count=\"2\">\n    <div class=\"logocarousel--inner-container\">\n        <ul role=\"list\" class=\"logocarousel-list\" style=\"--logo-count:2;\">\n                                <li class=\"logocarousel-item\">\n                        <div class=\"logocarousel-wrap\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"249\" height=\"245\" src=\"/images/2024/03/OnCallAir-Customer-First-Award-Winner.png\" class=\"logocarousel-image\" alt=\"OnCallAir Customer First Award Winner\" sizes=\"(max-width: 680px) 150px, (max-width: 820px) 128px, (max-width: 1024px) 100px, 128px\" /></div>                    </li>\n                                    <li class=\"logocarousel-item\">\n                        <div class=\"logocarousel-wrap\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"252\" height=\"250\" src=\"/images/2024/03/North-American-Technician-Excellence-logo-NATE.png\" class=\"logocarousel-image\" alt=\"North American Technician Excellence logo (NATE) given to Happy Home in Durham, NC\" sizes=\"(max-width: 680px) 150px, (max-width: 820px) 128px, (max-width: 1024px) 100px, 128px\" srcset=\"/images/2024/03/North-American-Technician-Excellence-logo-NATE.png 252w, /images/2024/03/North-American-Technician-Excellence-logo-NATE-150x150.png 150w\" /></div>                    </li>\n                        </ul>\n    </div>\n</div></div>\n\n<div  class=\"container splitter mobile-flip-splitter splitter--uniform-height-stick-last\" style=\"--CTX-container-split-size: 0.5\">\n\n<div  class=\"splitter-column splitter-column--left splitter-column--start has-background has-primary-background-color\">\n    <div class=\"splitter-column-inner splitter-column-inner--contained splitter-column-inner--padded\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group flow has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading mt-3 has-primary-inverse-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-11\">Careers at Our Company</h2>\n\n<p class=\"has-primary-inverse-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-12 wp-block-paragraph\">Happy Home is setting up a new standard of HVAC, plumbing, drains, and Indoor Air Quality services with major improvements to reliability, convenience, and customer care. We equip our technicians with resources, training, and tools, so they can provide you with the best possible service outcome. Come join us; we protect the people and culture that make our branch great while ensuring our customers consistently receive the best possible care.</p>\n\n<a href=\"https://jobs.dayforcehcm.com/en-us/nearu/happyhome\" target=\"_blank\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"outline\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta my-3\">\n    <span >Open Positions</span>\n        <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronright\" /></svg>\n</a></div>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div  class=\"splitter-column splitter-column--right splitter-column--start has-background has-primary-inverse-background-color\">\n    <div class=\"splitter-column-inner\">\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full has-custom-border full-height-image mobile-3-2-ratio\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\" src=\"/images/2024/03/A-Happy-Home-Service-technician-inspecting-a-boiler.jpg\" alt=\"A Happy Home Services technician inspecting a boiler\" class=\"wp-image-4795\" style=\"border-radius:0px\" srcset=\"/images/2024/03/A-Happy-Home-Service-technician-inspecting-a-boiler.jpg 1920w, /images/2024/03/A-Happy-Home-Service-technician-inspecting-a-boiler-300x200.jpg 300w, /images/2024/03/A-Happy-Home-Service-technician-inspecting-a-boiler-1024x683.jpg 1024w, /images/2024/03/A-Happy-Home-Service-technician-inspecting-a-boiler-768x512.jpg 768w, /images/2024/03/A-Happy-Home-Service-technician-inspecting-a-boiler-1536x1024.jpg 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\" /></figure>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-bcc66be2 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center py-4 has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-13\">One of North Carolina’s Oldest &amp; Most Trusted HVAC and Plumbing Providers<br>We Serve the Entire Research Triangle!</h2>\n\n<div id=\"our-community\" class=\"container splitter mobile-flip-splitter has-background has-white-background-color\" style=\"--CTX-container-split-size: 0.5\">\n\n<div  class=\"splitter-column splitter-column--left splitter-column--center splitter-column--padded-edge\">\n    <div class=\"splitter-column-inner splitter-column-inner--contained splitter-column-inner--padded\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group flow has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\"><div class=\"wp-block-site-logo\"><a href=\"/\" class=\"custom-logo-link\" rel=\"home\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"69\" src=\"/images/2024/03/Happy-Home-Services-logo.png\" class=\"custom-logo\" alt=\"Happy Home Services, a NearU Company, logo, an HVAC, Plumbing, and Indoor Air Quality services company in Durham, NC\" srcset=\"/images/2024/03/Happy-Home-Services-logo.png 800w, /images/2024/03/Happy-Home-Services-logo-300x104.png 300w, /images/2024/03/Happy-Home-Services-logo-768x265.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" /></a></div>\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading h-decorator h-decorator--primary has-primary-inverse-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-14\" style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:600\">Serving the Greater Durham &amp; Chapel Hill Communities for 70 Years!</h2>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Happy Home Services has been the trusted HVAC and plumbing company in <strong>Greater Durham</strong> and <strong>Chapel Hill, NC, </strong>since 1955. Our team of technicians is background-checked to ensure trustworthy professionals will be working in your home. Whether it&#8217;s 24/7 emergency repairs or scheduled maintenance, Happy Home Services is the go-to choice for all your heating, cooling, indoor air quality, plumbing, and drain needs in <strong>North Carolina</strong>.</p>\n\n<div  class=\